1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,475
Honey Bunny Kidz presents:

2
00:00:03,475 --> 00:00:06,175
Lulu Lamb's Big and Small Picnic!

3
00:00:06,525 --> 00:00:09,400
Let's play an opposite game together!

4
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:13,542
It was a bright,

5
00:00:13,542 --> 00:00:15,650
sunny morning on Sunny Hill.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,175
Mama Bunny brought a picnic basket.

7
00:00:19,925 --> 00:00:23,200
Who wants to help me get our picnic ready?

8
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:24,898
Me, me!

9
00:00:24,898 --> 00:00:26,225
I can help!

10
00:00:26,975 --> 00:00:28,711
I want to help too.

11
00:00:28,711 --> 00:00:30,368
But I am so small.

12
00:00:31,118 --> 00:00:32,309
Little Lulu,

13
00:00:32,309 --> 00:00:35,168
small friends can be big helpers.

14
00:00:35,518 --> 00:00:39,118
Let's play the Big and Small game on the way!

15
00:00:41,768 --> 00:00:42,998
Look, Lulu!

16
00:00:42,998 --> 00:00:44,493
Two red balls.

17
00:00:44,843 --> 00:00:45,934
One is big,

18
00:00:45,934 --> 00:00:47,493
and one is small.

19
00:00:48,243 --> 00:00:49,640
Which ball is big?

20
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:51,837
Can you point to the big ball?

21
00:00:55,737 --> 00:00:57,716
Yes! This ball is big.

22
00:00:57,716 --> 00:00:59,062
Big, big, big!

23
00:00:59,812 --> 00:01:01,577
And this ball is small.

24
00:01:01,577 --> 00:01:03,137
Small, small, small.

25
00:01:03,887 --> 00:01:06,811
I will carry the small ball.

26
00:01:07,162 --> 00:01:09,751
It is just right for me!

27
00:01:10,501 --> 00:01:12,111
And just like that,

28
00:01:12,111 --> 00:01:13,576
Lulu was helping.

29
00:01:16,226 --> 00:01:19,676
Then Dotty Duckling came waddling up the hill.

30
00:01:20,426 --> 00:01:21,896
Quack, quack!

31
00:01:21,896 --> 00:01:23,551
Hello, friends!

32
00:01:23,901 --> 00:01:26,876
Can I come to the picnic?

33
00:01:27,626 --> 00:01:28,692
Yes, Dotty!

34
00:01:28,692 --> 00:01:31,130
Look at Mama Bunny and Dotty.

35
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,720
Who is small?

36
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:34,114
Can you say it?

37
00:01:38,014 --> 00:01:39,444
Dotty is small!

38
00:01:39,444 --> 00:01:41,429
And Mama Bunny is big.

39
00:01:42,179 --> 00:01:43,473
Big or small,

40
00:01:43,473 --> 00:01:47,029
there is room for everyone at our picnic.

41
00:01:47,779 --> 00:01:50,547
Let's make our bodies big!

42
00:01:50,897 --> 00:01:52,143
Stand up tall,

43
00:01:52,143 --> 00:01:54,268
and spread your arms wide!

44
00:01:55,868 --> 00:01:57,700
Now make your body small.

45
00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:59,662
Curl up like a little ball.

46
00:02:01,262 --> 00:02:03,562
Quack! That was fun!

47
00:02:06,212 --> 00:02:07,799
Over by the slide,

48
00:02:07,799 --> 00:02:09,687
Pip Puppy was playing.

49
00:02:10,437 --> 00:02:11,241
Woof, woof!

50
00:02:11,241 --> 00:02:12,046
Look at me!

51
00:02:12,046 --> 00:02:13,424
I climbed the ladder,

52
00:02:13,424 --> 00:02:14,343
step by step.

53
00:02:15,093 --> 00:02:16,634
Is Pip up high,

54
00:02:16,634 --> 00:02:17,918
or down low?

55
00:02:18,268 --> 00:02:20,018
What do you think?

56
00:02:23,918 --> 00:02:25,043
Pip is up!

57
00:02:25,043 --> 00:02:26,686
Up, up, up high!

58
00:02:27,436 --> 00:02:30,026
Now I sit down and slide down.

59
00:02:30,376 --> 00:02:31,559
Wheee!

60
00:02:34,209 --> 00:02:35,688
Now Pip is down!

61
00:02:35,688 --> 00:02:37,557
Down, down, down low.

62
00:02:38,307 --> 00:02:39,664
Let's do it too!

63
00:02:39,664 --> 00:02:41,807
Reach your paws up, up, up!

64
00:02:43,207 --> 00:02:44,884
Now touch the ground.

65
00:02:44,884 --> 00:02:46,282
Down, down, down!

66
00:02:47,682 --> 00:02:50,204
Woof! Up and down is so much fun.

67
00:02:50,554 --> 00:02:52,741
Your turn on the slide, Honey!

68
00:02:55,391 --> 00:02:57,866
Then Pip ran to the picnic.

69
00:02:58,216 --> 00:02:59,456
Zoom, zoom!

70
00:02:59,456 --> 00:03:01,316
Pip was very fast.

71
00:03:02,066 --> 00:03:03,025
I am fast!

72
00:03:03,025 --> 00:03:04,499
Zoom, zoom, zoom!

73
00:03:05,249 --> 00:03:06,084
Wait, Pip!

74
00:03:06,084 --> 00:03:07,112
Stop, please!

75
00:03:07,112 --> 00:03:07,947
Look down,

76
00:03:07,947 --> 00:03:08,910
by your paw.

77
00:03:11,710 --> 00:03:13,414
It was a tiny snail,

78
00:03:13,414 --> 00:03:15,635
on the stepping stone path.

79
00:03:16,385 --> 00:03:18,119
Hello, little snail.

80
00:03:18,119 --> 00:03:20,381
Is the snail fast, or slow?

81
00:03:20,731 --> 00:03:22,673
Can you guess?

82
00:03:24,673 --> 00:03:26,388
The snail is slow.

83
00:03:26,388 --> 00:03:28,021
Slow, slow, slow.

84
00:03:28,771 --> 00:03:31,204
Oh! I did not see the little snail.

85
00:03:31,554 --> 00:03:32,716
Thank you, Lulu.

86
00:03:32,716 --> 00:03:34,366
I will walk slowly here.

87
00:03:35,116 --> 00:03:36,301
I am small,

88
00:03:36,301 --> 00:03:38,755
so I can see small things!

89
00:03:39,505 --> 00:03:40,423
Pip waited,

90
00:03:40,423 --> 00:03:43,505
and the little snail went slowly on its way.

91
00:03:46,155 --> 00:03:49,455
Lulu, you were a big helper today!

92
00:03:50,205 --> 00:03:51,906
Thank you, Mama Bunny!

93
00:03:51,906 --> 00:03:54,423
Let's sing the Big and Small song.

94
00:03:54,773 --> 00:03:57,095
Do the moves with me!

95
00:03:57,845 --> 00:03:58,882
Big, big,

96
00:03:58,882 --> 00:04:00,523
stretch up tall!

97
00:04:01,023 --> 00:04:02,344
Small, small,

98
00:04:02,344 --> 00:04:03,747
curl up small!

99
00:04:04,247 --> 00:04:05,189
Up, up,

100
00:04:05,189 --> 00:04:06,791
reach the sky!

101
00:04:07,291 --> 00:04:08,440
Down, down,

102
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,081
touch the ground!

103
00:04:10,581 --> 00:04:11,519
Fast, fast,

104
00:04:11,519 --> 00:04:12,858
wiggle your feet!

105
00:04:13,358 --> 00:04:14,544
Slow, slow,

106
00:04:14,544 --> 00:04:16,662
like a snail so sweet!

107
00:04:17,162 --> 00:04:18,522
Big and small,

108
00:04:18,522 --> 00:04:19,962
short and tall,

109
00:04:20,362 --> 00:04:21,753
we are friends,

110
00:04:21,753 --> 00:04:22,912
one and all!

111
00:04:25,812 --> 00:04:28,612
Everyone sat down for the picnic.

112
00:04:28,962 --> 00:04:32,212
The little snail rested in the warm sun.

113
00:04:32,962 --> 00:04:35,787
Let's take a calm breath together.

114
00:04:36,137 --> 00:04:37,443
Breathe in,

115
00:04:37,443 --> 00:04:38,937
big and slow.

116
00:04:40,737 --> 00:04:42,277
And breathe out,

117
00:04:42,277 --> 00:04:43,737
small and soft.

118
00:04:45,537 --> 00:04:47,254
What was your favourite?

119
00:04:47,254 --> 00:04:48,272
Big or small,

120
00:04:48,272 --> 00:04:49,162
up or down,

121
00:04:49,162 --> 00:04:50,180
fast or slow?

122
00:04:52,180 --> 00:04:54,233
I like them all!

123
00:04:56,883 --> 00:04:58,014
Big or small,

124
00:04:58,014 --> 00:04:59,499
everyone can help,

125
00:04:59,499 --> 00:05:01,408
and everyone is special.

126
00:05:02,158 --> 00:05:06,258
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

127
00:05:06,858 --> 00:05:08,456
Baa! Bye-bye, friends!

128
00:05:08,456 --> 00:05:11,077
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!
